      "name": "Obtenebration — 1 Basic — Shroud of Night",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-evil-horned-summon.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>By spending a Blood Trait, you summon a roughly ten-foot sphere of light-absorbing, sound-muffling darkness (placeable at range for an extra Blood Trait) that disorients and can strangle mortals caught within, lasting a scene or hour.</p>",
